{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 30/09/2024, the use of the outbuilding at 14 Springvale Avenue as a separate self-contained dwelling was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove that on the balance of probabilities, the use of the outbuilding at 14 Springvale Avenue as a separate self-contained dwelling has been in existence continuously for more than four years and would therefore be unlawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n"
  ],
